1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. d4 cxd4 4. Nxd4 Nf6 5. Nc3 d6 6. Bg5 Qa5 7. Bb5 Bd7 8.
Nb3 Qc7 9. Qd2 a6 10. Bxc6 Bxc6 11. O-O-O $1 {Aitken.} Nxe4 12. Nxe4 Bxe4 13.
Rhe1 Bg6 14. Re3 Rc8 15. Rc3 Qd7 $2 {Aitken.} 16. Nc5 Qb5 17. Qxd6 {Wow! did
not expect that. Geoff Chandler.} exd6 {Note in margin from Aitken. "Correct
was 17....f6! which must win for Black." he then adds, " No. White plays 18.
Qd5 fxg5 19.a4!!} (17... f6 18. Qd5 fxg5 19. a4 Qc6 20. Nxb7 Qxd5 21. Rxc8+ Kd7
22. Rd8+ Kc6 23. R1xd5 Kxb7 24. Rc5 {With Rcc8 to follow is what Aitken
probably intended.}) 18. Re1+ Be7 19. Rxe7+ Kd8 $2 {Aitken.} (19... Kf8 20.
Nd7+ Qxd7 21. Rxd7 {winning G.C.}) 20. Rxf7+ Ke8 21. Re7+ Kf8 22. Ne6+ 1-0

