{The Times, 11 February 1935, reports on the simul. Aitken was the only player
to defeat Sir George Thomas, whose overall score was +9, =2, -1. He drew with
NA Perkins (St John's) and J. Mac'C. Armstrong (Christ Church). Those who lost:
Graham Powell Britton (Jesus), FG Tims Collins (Balliol), RT Spencer (Wadham),
RA Sayce (Jesus), WF Darke (Balliol), J Anscombe (Wadham), AJ Peters (Christ
Church), AG Palmer (Merton), J Atkinson (Jesus) - JS} 0-1

