53... b2 {led to a win after} 54. Rb5 Rxf4 {, and this appears to be correct."
(Aitken)}) 54. Ka7 {(second sealed move)} Ra4+ 55. Kb8 b2 56. Rb5 Rxf4 57. g7
Rg4 58. Ra5+ Kb3 59. Rb5+ Kc3 60. Rc5+ Kd3 61. Rb5 Rg2 62. Kc8 Kc3 63. Rc5+ {
Source: Glasgow Herald, 23 September 1938} 1/2-1/2

