Nf5+ Kf7 43. Rb6 Nc7 44. Rb7 Rc3 45. g4 Kf6 46. Kg3 Ne6 47. h4 Rc6 48. Ne3 Rd6
49. Rb6 Rxb6 50. Nd5+ Kg6 51. Nxb6 h5 52. g5 Nd4 53. Nd5 Nf5+ 54. Kh3 Kf7 {
Times 2.02 and 2.06. Aitken. Source: Aitken Book 14} 1/2-1/2

