{"Finally, a game from the second round, with notes kindly supplied by Alfred
Lord Tennyson" (Aitken, BCM)} 1. e4 e6 2. d4 d5 3. e5 c5 4. c3 Nc6 5. Nf3 Nge7
6. Bd3 Ng6 $2 {Some one had blunder'd.} 7. h4 {Half a league,} cxd4 8. cxd4
Bb4+ 9. Nc3 Bd7 10. h5 {Half a league,} Nge7 11. h6 {Half a league onward,} g6
12. a3 Bxc3+ 13. bxc3 Qa5 14. Qb3 a6 15. O-O Qc7 16. Bg5 Na5 17. Qb4 Nec6 18.
Qb2 Nc4 19. Bxc4 {While horse and hero fell,} dxc4 20. Nd2 b5 21. Ne4 O-O {
Into the jaws of Death,} 22. Nf6+ {'Forward, the Light Brigade.'} Kh8 23. Qd2
Na5 24. Qf4 Bc6 25. Nd5 {Source: BCM, September 1956, p233} 1-0

